{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>I saw</b> — In the visions of prophecy he saw the glory of HaShem standing upon the altar, and He commanded one of the angels: הך כפתור — strike the lintel of the house of YHWH, for so is the custom to place a kaphtor above the doorway, and it is like an apple, upon which the thresholds lean." "<b>And break them</b> — like ופצעם, from the same root, for all the people of the house, who are the priests, shall be wounded." "<b>And their remnant</b> — their children, like: ולא לאחריתו."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:40.024624440Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}